  <section class="content narrow">
    <h2>Helping readers move from research to purchase</h2>
    <p>Our guides are written for Australian households making decisions about appliances, cleaning, heating and cooling, storage, home technology and everyday home essentials. We focus on the practical questions that shape a purchase: dimensions, installation clearances, suitability, maintenance and ongoing costs.</p>
    <p>As an affiliate publisher, our aim is to turn useful guidance into informed purchase referrals. Relevant retailer links help readers check a suitable product and buy when they are ready. Qualifying purchases can earn AHC a commission, supporting the work behind our guides.</p>

    <h2>Our buying resources in practice</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/guides/dishwasher-sizes-australia/">Dishwasher sizes in Australia</a> helps readers assess appliance dimensions, cabinet space and installation requirements before choosing a model.</li>
      <li><a href="/guides/fridge-dimensions-australia/">Fridge dimensions in Australia</a> helps readers consider the space a fridge needs, including ventilation and door clearance.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Explore our <a href="/guides/">guides</a> for more examples of how we approach household buying decisions.</p>

    <h2>Where we are heading</h2>
    <p>We are strengthening our buying guides, product comparisons and practical resources to give readers a clearer path from research to purchase. Our priority is useful coverage that connects a household need with a suitable product and an Australian retailer able to fulfil it.</p>
    <p>We are seeking long-term affiliate relationships with established Australian retailers and relevant brands. We want to build sustainable partnerships around informed referrals, attributable purchases and recommendations readers can trust.</p>

    <h2>Ways we can work together</h2>
    <p>Relevant products and retailers may be considered for inclusion in buying guides, product comparisons and contextual recommendations. We also share selected guides through our organic social channels. Every proposed placement must fit the question the guide is helping a reader answer.</p>
    <p>Retailers can help by providing accurate product links, current Australian range and availability information, delivery coverage and affiliate programme details. Brands can provide specifications, manuals and product information for editorial consideration.</p>

    <h2>How we make editorial decisions</h2>
    <p>A partnership does not guarantee coverage or a positive recommendation. We assess products for suitability and drawbacks, distinguish research from hands-on testing, and disclose qualifying affiliate links. Product details and Australian availability must be checked before a placement is published.</p>
    <p>Read <a href="/how-we-select-products/">how we select products and guide topics</a>, our <a href="/editorial-standards/">Editorial Standards</a> and our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>For brand, retailer and affiliate partnership enquiries, contact <strong>Shane Tottenham, Founder &amp; Publisher</strong>, at <a href="mailto:Contact@australianhomecollective.com.au">Contact@australianhomecollective.com.au</a> or use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
    <p>Please include your brand or retailer, relevant product categories, Australian availability and the proposed partnership or affiliate programme details.</p>
  </section>
